<title>UK: AIDC sets A$200 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>AIDC sets A$200 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AIDC LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  COMMONWEALTH OF AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    A$200 MLN     COUPON     7.0 PCT   MATURITY    30.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.47    PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75 PCT  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/AU/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25 PCT  SELL CONC  1.50 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
